```{=html}
<div class="home-posts list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<a class="home-post" href="<%- item.path %>" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
  <% if (item.date) { %><span class="home-post-date listing-date"><%= item.date %></span><% } %>
  <span class="home-post-title listing-title"><%= item.title %></span>
  <% if (item.description) { %><span class="home-post-desc listing-description"><%= item.description %></span><% } %>
</a>
<% } %>
</div>
```
